      "chunk_text": "Aditi Mahajan calls insurance agent Neha Kapoor because her current health policy is expiring on 30/09/2026 and cannot be renewed due to being phased out. Concerned about a coverage gap, Aditi agrees to switch to the 'Balanced Care' plan at \u20b94,850 per month. Neha confirms she will send the enrollment form and a confirmation email, with the new policy becoming effective on 01/10/2026.",
